## Executive Summary

Canada.ca operates on Adobe AEM, a platform selected over a decade ago for a world without modern search, AI. Today, that architecture presents well-known challenges: **$Millions in annual total costs**, **a delay publish pipeline**, **difficult to migrate new department of content**, and **no native database, search, or AI capabilities** — all of which must be outsourced to separate vendors.

We offer a fundamentally different approach — not a proposal for a future system, but a **working, verifiable platform** built today:

> **Designed by 20 years of Canada.ca experience. Developed by an AI-empowered team. Verifiable on demand. Operationally proven.**

Our platform consists of two integrated systems — **WebBot** (intranet content management, AI-augmented) and **FileBot** (mature asset management & delivery system, under continuous development since 2017 with active deployments) — that together provide a complete, secure, and cost-effective content management platform.

